  "description": "Seo Dain is the precious only daughter of the Seogwang Group's chairman. If there is something she wants, she must have it by any means necessary. \n\n\"Why on earth would I marry you?\" \n\n\"Why? Where else could you find a bride as perfect as me?\" \n\nThe man she has fixated on is none other than her father's loyal dog. So, this is the story of making that dog her own.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14966686)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14966688)",
